    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cubetory</strong> is a factory-building game with a pure automation focus. Place mining drills, conveyor belts, launchers, stampers, power stations, and tons of other machines as you build your factory.<br><strong></strong><br><strong>Space is limited</strong>, and <strong>resource patches are unique</strong>. Each new paint/ore patch you encounter will have to be used efficiently to meet the production requirements to unlock the next upgrades.\u00a0As you progress, you'll grow your island, unlock new technologies, and uncover new resources. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>no enemies or time limits</strong>, you'll have all the time you need to figure it out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027060/extras/4a8c5b9a333387d6dfc7c8e77c6b96e4.poster.avif?t=1752249543\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027060/extras/4a8c5b9a333387d6dfc7c8e77c6b96e4.webm?t=1752249543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027060/extras/4a8c5b9a333387d6dfc7c8e77c6b96e4.mp4?t=1752249543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Paint-based manufacturing with the P.I.T.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything you produce in <strong>Cubetory</strong> is a cube, and all cubes end up in the <strong>PIT</strong>. Early game, that means mining cubes and painting them a specific pattern. Complexity quickly ramps up from there with assembly chains, byproducts, non-deterministic processes, and more.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027060/extras/3beab41ce1b0fe25ea3bf15acc1c7ce5.poster.avif?t=1752249543\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027060/extras/3beab41ce1b0fe25ea3bf15acc1c7ce5.webm?t=1752249543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027060/extras/3beab41ce1b0fe25ea3bf15acc1c7ce5.mp4?t=1752249543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cubetory</strong> is a factory-building game with a pure automation focus. Place mining drills, conveyor belts, launchers, stampers, power stations, and tons of other machines as you build your factory.<br><strong></strong><br><strong>Space is limited</strong>, and <strong>resource patches are unique</strong>. Each new paint/ore patch you encounter will have to be used efficiently to meet the production requirements to unlock the next upgrades.\u00a0As you progress, you'll grow your island, unlock new technologies, and uncover new resources. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>no enemies or time limits</strong>, you'll have all the time you need to figure it out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027060/extras/4a8c5b9a333387d6dfc7c8e77c6b96e4.poster.avif?t=1752249543\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027060/extras/4a8c5b9a333387d6dfc7c8e77c6b96e4.webm?t=1752249543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027060/extras/4a8c5b9a333387d6dfc7c8e77c6b96e4.mp4?t=1752249543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Paint-based manufacturing with the P.I.T.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything you produce in <strong>Cubetory</strong> is a cube, and all cubes end up in the <strong>PIT</strong>. Early game, that means mining cubes and painting them a specific pattern. Complexity quickly ramps up from there with assembly chains, byproducts, non-deterministic processes, and more.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027060/extras/3beab41ce1b0fe25ea3bf15acc1c7ce5.poster.avif?t=1752249543\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027060/extras/3beab41ce1b0fe25ea3bf15acc1c7ce5.webm?t=1752249543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027060/extras/3beab41ce1b0fe25ea3bf15acc1c7ce5.mp4?t=1752249543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Build a huge factory on a tiny island! Resources are scarce and unique - tweak and optimize everything for peak efficiency. Start with simple painted cubes, unlock 100+ upgrades, and scale up to complex production chains. No enemies, just satisfying spaghetti.",
